  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お母さん、全然声出してなかったみたいです\r\nライブの日",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "妹は雛菜ちゃんのお母さんと一緒に\r\nいっぱい声出して来たって笑ってましたけど",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00527",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お母さんは、ずっと不安そうに手を握って\r\nわたしの方を見てたって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そりゃそうですよね\r\n最後なんて、フラフラだったし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "三者面談で学校の先生にすら\r\nいつも自信がなさそう、なんて言われてるのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あんな大きなステージに立ってるなんて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00017",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………\r\nもしかしたら、少しくらいは喜んでもらえるんじゃないかって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "思ってたんですけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060100"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0344",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 5000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルをするにあたってさ\r\n親御さんに反対されるのは、珍しいことじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "多分、色々なことを真剣に考えてくれてるからこそ\r\n簡単には賛成できないんだと思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルとして活動することだけじゃなくて\r\n日常の生活も、その先のこととかも含めて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060110"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん賛成してくれていて、\r\n手放しで応援してくれているように見える親御さんだって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "心配が無いわけじゃない\r\n不安にさせてしまうことだって、あると思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………\r\nそう、なんですかね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸の親御さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "終わった後に言ってたよ\r\n『これからもよろしくお願いします』って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！\r\nえ……わ、わたしには、そんなの、全然……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nだから内緒な、この話",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうだったんだ…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "また、ライブ来てもらおう\r\nそれでいつかはさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当に楽しかったって喜んでもらえるようになろう\r\n……そういう機会を、作っていくから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
