  {
    "id": 1022004060150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……ひとつわかったことがあるんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00017",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたし、アイドルってすごく大勢の人を\r\n笑顔にしたり、元気を与えるような人なんだって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そう思ってたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060170"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00527",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だからたくさんの人が、わたしたちのライブを\r\n自分の居場所だって思ってくれたらいいなって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだよな\r\n小糸は最初から、そういう目標を持ってくれてた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "も、もちろん、それができたら\r\n一番いいんですけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00017",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だけど今回のワンマンライブを通して……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "いつも近くに居る人とか、\r\n今応援してくれてるファンの人をもっと大事にしたいなって",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そういう人に喜んでもらって\r\nそれで──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "すごいねって、歓声が聞きたいのかもって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか\r\nなるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "も、もっと高い目標を持った方がいいのかもしれないし\r\nアイドルとして、これでいいのかわからないですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200406/1022004060240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004060250,
